Package: pertEvalR
Type: Package
Title: Calibrated Evaluation of Single-Cell Perturbation Response Predictions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", email = "you@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A framework for evaluating models that predict transcriptional
    responses to genetic or chemical perturbations from single-cell data
    (for example Perturb-seq). Provides standard data splits, simple
    reference baselines (control and training-mean predictions), and is
    designed to grow into calibrated metrics, signal diagnostics and
    statistical comparison of models.
